Stargate development benchmark - dependency attribution

Dependencies are fetched from crates.io; their sources and license texts are
not vendored in this repository. Cargo.lock records exact versions and checksums.
The package links below identify the corresponding upstream source and license
files. Preserve the applicable license notices when distributing a built binary.

MIT is selected where available; otherwise Apache-2.0 is selected. unicode-ident
also requires Unicode-3.0 for its Unicode data. That supplemental license is
already used by the repository Rust workspace but is absent from the root
license allowlist; this discrepancy is reported in the pull request.

